{"seq":3,"slug":"incremental-evaluation-tuning-retract-memory","title":"增量求值调优与状态爆炸治理：节点共享、索引、retract 与内存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/business-rule-decision-engine-rete-dmnn-drools-cel-opa/rete-incremental-evaluation/incremental-evaluation-tuning-retract-memory","wordCount":2941,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"增量求值调优与状态爆炸治理-节点共享-索引-retract-与内存\">增量求值调优与状态爆炸治理：节点共享、索引、retract 与内存</h1><p>跨境风控规则集上线后最常见的故障不是「算错」，而是「越跑越慢」：一次大促期间订单流与报关单流并发插入，Rete 网络里某个 join 节点的部分匹配数从几十万涨到千万级，Old Generation 持续被占用，Full GC 间隔从分钟级压到秒级，最终触发 <code>OutOfMemoryError</code> 或规则求值超时。这类退化很少来自规则写错，绝大多数来自<strong>网络结构、索引选择、约束排序与 retract 时机</strong>四个可调参数。本文聚焦怎么定位、怎么改、改完怎么验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>RETE 用记忆换时间，代价就落在「部分匹配」这个量上。上一节已经把网络拓扑讲清楚（见 <a href=\"rete-network-alpha-beta-node-topology\">RETE 网络拓扑</a>），这里只关心它的成本函数。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个 beta 节点的左记忆规模为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|L_i|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>、右记忆规模为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|R_i|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>，该节点的部分匹配数近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mtext>PM</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>≈</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\text{PM}_i| \\;\\approx\\; |L_i| \\cdot \\sigma_i \\cdot |R_i|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PM</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_i \\in (0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 是该节点 join 约束的选择率（selectivity）——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越接近 1，说明条件几乎不过滤，连接结果几乎等于笛卡尔积。整张网络的内存占用是各节点部分匹配之和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>RETE</mtext></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∝</mo><mtext>  </mtext><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>beta nodes</mtext></mrow></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mtext>PM</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{\\text{RETE}} \\;\\propto\\; \\sum_{i \\in \\text{beta nodes}} |\\text{PM}_i|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">RETE</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3795em;vertical-align:-1.3295em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">beta nodes</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3295em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PM</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这两条式子解释了「状态爆炸」的本质：<strong>只要有一个高扇出、低选择率的 join，它就能用乘积把小规模事实集放大成亿级元组</strong>。调优的全部工作，就是把这个乘积的每一项压下去。</p>\n<p>增量求值（incremental evaluation）指 insert / update / retract 只传播 delta。理想情况下单次事件成本正比于受影响的元组数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>PM</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\Delta \\text{PM}|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PM</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>，而非全量重算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(R \\cdot F^P)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0913em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；但 delta 会被索引结构和共享节点放大——一个被多条规则共享的上游节点一旦更新，其下游全部规则都要处理传播，这正是共享的暗面。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[事实流 insert/update/retract] --&gt; B[类型路由 ObjectTypeNode]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Alpha 链&lt;br/&gt;按选择率排序]&#10;    C --&gt; D[AlphaMemory]&#10;    D --&gt; E[索引化 JoinNode&lt;br/&gt;AbstractHashTable]&#10;    E --&gt; F[部分匹配元组&lt;br/&gt;成本 ~ |L|·sigma·|R|]&#10;    F --&gt; G{部分匹配数是否受控}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[TerminalNode&lt;br/&gt;激活 agenda]&#10;    G --&gt;|否| I[状态爆炸&lt;br/&gt;GC 压力/超时]&#10;    I --&gt; J[加选择率约束&lt;br/&gt;拆规则/调索引/降共享]&#10;    J --&gt; C&#10;    H --&gt; K[retract 反向删除子元组]&#10;    K --&gt; L[回收 BetaMemory&lt;br/&gt;回滚 agenda 激活]\">graph TD\n    A[事实流 insert/update/retract] --&gt; B[类型路由 ObjectTypeNode]\n    B --&gt; C[Alpha 链&lt;br/&gt;按选择率排序]\n    C --&gt; D[AlphaMemory]\n    D --&gt; E[索引化 JoinNode&lt;br/&gt;AbstractHashTable]\n    E --&gt; F[部分匹配元组&lt;br/&gt;成本 ~ |L|·sigma·|R|]\n    F --&gt; G{部分匹配数是否受控}\n    G --&gt;|是| H[TerminalNode&lt;br/&gt;激活 agenda]\n    G --&gt;|否| I[状态爆炸&lt;br/&gt;GC 压力/超时]\n    I --&gt; J[加选择率约束&lt;br/&gt;拆规则/调索引/降共享]\n    J --&gt; C\n    H --&gt; K[retract 反向删除子元组]\n    K --&gt; L[回收 BetaMemory&lt;br/&gt;回滚 agenda 激活]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调优维度</th>\n<th>直接控制的量</th>\n<th>典型手段</th>\n<th>副作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>约束排序</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 进入 join 前的候选规模</td>\n<td>高选择率约束前移、谓词下推</td>\n<td>网络重建，需回归测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>索引化 join</td>\n<td>右记忆扫描成本</td>\n<td>建 <code>AbstractHashTable</code>、选对 join 键</td>\n<td>更新时需维护索引一致性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>节点共享</td>\n<td>重复匹配次数</td>\n<td>合并等价 alpha 节点、统一约束写法</td>\n<td>上游更新波及面变宽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规则拆分</td>\n<td>$</td>\n<td>R_i</td>\n<td>$ 与 join 扇出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>retract 时机</td>\n<td>记忆存活期</td>\n<td>及时撤回中间事实、<code>delete</code> 而非长期留存</td>\n<td>逻辑正确性需 Truth Maintenance 保证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"部分匹配爆炸的成因与识别\">部分匹配爆炸的成因与识别</h2><p>判断是否爆炸，靠的是<strong>每节点记忆计数</strong>，不是规则文本。Drools 提供了 <code>KieBase</code> 层面的节点统计与 <code>ReteDumper</code>（<code>org.drools.core.reteoo.ReteDumper</code>，输出 DOT 图），把网络连同各记忆节点规模画出来。实务做法是：先在 <code>kmodule</code> / <code>KieBase</code> 配置里打开统计，跑一轮近生产规模的负载，导出每类 <code>BetaMemory</code> 的元组计数，找计数最高的 3 个节点。</p>\n<p>成因通常归为四类：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>笛卡尔积陷阱</strong>：join 约束写成不相关字段比较（拿 <code>order.buyerId</code> 去 join <code>declaration.buyerId</code>，两边基数都很大），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma \\approx 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。跨境电商里「订单 × 商品行 × 税率表」若没按 <code>hsCode</code> 收窄，就是典型。</li>\n<li><strong>弱过滤 alpha 节点</strong>：形如 <code>Order( status != &quot;CANCELLED&quot; )</code> 这种命中 95% 以上事实的约束，过滤力几乎为零，把成本全推给下游 beta。</li>\n<li><strong>NOT / EXISTS 计数器失控</strong>：<code>NotNode</code> 对每个左元组维护计数，左元组基数巨大时总量线性膨胀。</li>\n<li><strong>accumulate 中间集合无界</strong>：无 <code>from</code> 限制时收集列表长度等于该 group 的全部事实数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>识别工具除记忆计数还有 JMX 下的 <code>RuleBase</code> / <code>WorkingMemory</code> MBean，可观察激活数与 agenda size；agenda size 随事实数超线性增长时，几乎可以断定存在低选择率 join。</p>\n<h2 id=\"索引化-join-与约束排序\">索引化 join 与约束排序</h2><p>索引是降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|R_i|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 实际扫描量的第一手段。Drools 用 <code>AbstractHashTable</code> 为右侧 <code>AlphaMemory</code> 建哈希桶，左元组进来时按 join 键直接定位桶，把扫描量从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(|R|)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到桶平均长度。Drools 源码里 <code>PhreakJoinNode</code> 在右元组批量插入超过阈值（经验值 32）时会调用 <code>ensureCapacity</code> 预扩容，避免反复 rehash——这个阈值本身可调，在批量导入场景把右记忆一次性喂满比逐条插入快得多。</p>\n<p>索引不是免费的，它带来两条约束：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>join 键必须可哈希</strong>。若 join 用的是范围比较（<code>amount BETWEEN</code>、时间区间重叠），哈希索引失效，退化为线性扫描。此时应改为等值键 + 后置范围过滤，或接受成本但把范围约束放在选择率更高的一侧。</li>\n<li><strong>更新必须维护索引一致性</strong>。当左元组的连接键被 <code>update</code> 改变，节点必须判断「索引已变，删除此前传播的子元组再重建」。Drools 的做法是把基于旧键产生的子元组整体 <code>delete</code> 掉。这意味着<strong>频繁更新 join 键的字段远比更新非 join 字段昂贵</strong>——工程上应避免把易变字段（如实时风控评分）放进 join 键。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>约束排序的规则很简单：<strong>把选择率最高的约束放最前</strong>。在网络里这对应两件事——alpha 链上把强约束节点插在前面，让弱约束只在缩小后的集合上求值；beta 侧把能独立判定的谓词下推到 alpha 段，减少流入 join 的元组数。注意 RETE 的约束合并依赖<strong>字面写法一致</strong>：<code>amount &gt; 100</code> 与 <code>amount &gt;= 100.01</code> 语义等价却会生成两个 alpha 节点，无法共享。统一写法是零成本的调优动作。</p>\n<p>对于多路 join，join 的<strong>树形结构</strong>比线性链更重要。把选择率高的连接放在树的內侧（先做），可以显著降低下游各节点的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|L_i|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>。Drools 会按约束顺序构建 join 树，因此规则里条件的书写顺序直接决定网络形状。</p>\n<h2 id=\"retract-与内存回收\">retract 与内存回收</h2><p>retract（撤回）是增量求值里最容易被忽视的一半。RETE 的 Truth Maintenance 保证：撤回一个事实时，由它参与产生的<strong>全部下游子元组必须被反向删除</strong>，agenda 中依赖这些子元组的激活必须回滚。删除成本正比于该事实的部分匹配数，量级与插入同阶：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>传播方向</th>\n<th>主要工作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>insert</td>\n<td>正向展开</td>\n<td>写入 AlphaMemory，扫描右记忆建元组，产生 agenda 激活</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>update</td>\n<td>正向 + 索引重建</td>\n<td>若 join 键变，删除旧子元组再建新；否则仅重判受影响约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>retract</td>\n<td>反向拆除</td>\n<td>递归删除该 WME 派生的所有子元组，回滚激活，释放记忆</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>治理状态爆炸的关键是<strong>让中间事实的存活期尽可能短</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>不用长期事实承载中间结果</strong>。把「临时评分」「中间聚合」写成规则内的局部变量或 <code>insertLogical</code>，后者建立 TMS 依赖：支撑条件撤销时事实自动 retract。</li>\n<li><strong>大对象按需 <code>from</code> 引用</strong>，而非整表 <code>insert</code> 成事实。把百万级汇率表整个灌进工作内存会让每个 join 的右记忆基数失控。</li>\n<li><strong>分阶段清理</strong>：不相关的规则集放进不同 entry point 或 KieSession，避免单个 session 的 BetaMemory 无限累积。</li>\n<li><strong>滚动窗口</strong>：流式场景用 Drools Fusion 的 <code>sliding window</code>，事实滑出窗口时自动撤回。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个常见反模式是「只 insert 不 retract」——把工作内存当成一个不断增长的消息队列。这在长驻 KieSession（server 内嵌、sidecar 常驻）场景下必然 OOM，因为 BetaMemory 只增不减。凡是要长驻的 session，都必须有明确的撤回路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"phreak-调度与集合化传播调优\">Phreak 调度与集合化传播调优</h2><p>Drools 主线已从 ReteOO 演进到 <strong>Phreak</strong> 执行算法；据 Drools 项目稳定版为 10.x 系列，Phreak 自 Drools 6 起成为默认。它不改网络拓扑，改的是<strong>何时求值、以多大粒度求值</strong>，这对内存曲线影响很大：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>三段结构</strong>：段（segment）把一条线性节点链聚合，传播以段为单位，减少逐节点调度开销。</li>\n<li><strong>规则级惰性求值</strong>：规则被 agenda 需要时才展开，避免构造永远不会触发的元组。</li>\n<li><strong>集合化传播</strong>：一次 <code>doNode</code> 处理 <code>TupleSets</code>（插入 / 更新 / 删除分桶），按「先删、再改、最后插」成批处理，处理完统一 <code>resetAll()</code>。这意味着<strong>批量插入远比逐条插入高效</strong>——逐条会放大固定开销。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对应的调优动作：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>批量投喂事实</strong>。一批订单用 <code>insertAll</code> 或循环 insert 后一次性 <code>fireAllRules</code>，让集合化路径生效。</li>\n<li><strong>避免在规则 RHS 里做重活</strong>。RHS 中调用远程服务、写库会把传播开销和 IO 混在同一个临界区，既难观测也拖垮吞吐。RHS 只应产出事实或收集结果。</li>\n<li><strong>慎用大量 low salience 规则交织</strong>。高优先级规则先跑产生更多中间事实再被低优先级规则消费，形成多轮传播；用顺序规则代替 salience 排序通常更省内存。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"调优验证与常见陷阱\">调优验证与常见陷阱</h2><p>调完必须量化验证，否则容易「看起来快了」。最小验证集：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>网络节点记忆计数</strong>：改造前后对比 top-N BetaMemory 元组数，目标是把峰值部分匹配数降到原来的 1/3 以内。</li>\n<li><strong>单事件传播成本</strong>：在 <code>fireAllRules</code> 边界埋点，测 99 分位延迟而非只看均值。</li>\n<li><strong>GC 与常驻内存</strong>：Old Gen 占用与 Full GC 频率是状态爆炸最直接的信号。</li>\n<li><strong>正确性回归</strong>：约束重排、规则拆分、索引调整都可能改变激活顺序，必须用 <code>Scenario</code> / <code>KieSession</code> 测试集重跑。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>陷阱清单：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>把 <code>update</code> 用在只变非 join 字段的事实上仍触发索引重建——确认 <code>property reactive</code>（<code>@PropertyReactive</code>）已启用，否则任何 <code>update</code> 都被当作全字段变化，波及所有下游。</li>\n<li>为了「减少规则数」把多条规则塞进一条超长 <code>when</code>，反而制造新的笛卡尔积。</li>\n<li>用 <code>eval</code> 承载本可下推到 alpha 段的谓词，过滤发生在 beta 段时为时已晚。</li>\n<li>索引阈值 / 批量大小照搬默认值而未按数据分布调整。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本章只讨论增量求值的性能与内存；引擎分层选型见 <a href=\"../rule-engine-model-decision-architecture/\">规则引擎模型与决策架构</a>，决策表表达见 <a href=\"../dmn-decision-table-expression/\">DMN 决策表与表达式求值</a>，上线后的测试与灰度治理见 <a href=\"../rule-governance-testing-ops/\">规则治理、测试与运维</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>状态爆炸的本质是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mtext>PM</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\text{PM}_i| \\approx |L_i| \\cdot \\sigma_i \\cdot |R_i|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PM</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 中的低选择率 join 用乘积放大事实集；治理就是逐项压小这个乘积。</li>\n<li>识别靠<strong>每节点记忆计数</strong>（<code>ReteDumper</code> DOT 图、KieBase 统计、JMX MBean），不靠读规则文本。</li>\n<li>索引化 join（<code>AbstractHashTable</code>）把右记忆扫描降到桶级，代价是 join 键必须可哈希、且更新 join 键要重建索引——易变字段不要放进 join 键。</li>\n<li>约束排序原则：选择率最高的约束前置；字面写法统一才能被网络合并成同一 alpha 节点。</li>\n<li>retract 成本与插入同阶，必须给中间事实明确的存活期；用 <code>insertLogical</code> 建立自动撤回依赖，用 sliding window / entry point 隔离限制记忆增长。</li>\n<li>Phreak 用 node / segment / rule 分层与集合化传播（<code>TupleSets</code> 删/改/插分桶），批量投喂事实远比逐条插入高效。</li>\n<li>调优必须量化验证峰值部分匹配数、99 分位传播延迟、Old Gen 与 Full GC 频率，并对网络结构改动做正确性回归。</li>\n<li>主要参考：Forgy 1982《Rete: A Fast Algorithm for the Many Pattern/Many Object Pattern Match Problem》(DOI: 10.1016/0004-3702(82)90020-0)；Drools 源码 <code>kiegroup/drools</code> 的 <code>reteoo/</code>、<code>phreak/</code> 包（<code>ReteDumper</code>、<code>PhreakJoinNode</code>、<code>AbstractHashTable</code>）；Rete 算法词条（en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rete_algorithm）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"增量求值调优与状态爆炸治理：节点共享、索引、retract 与内存","id":"增量求值调优与状态爆炸治理-节点共享-索引-retract-与内存"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"部分匹配爆炸的成因与识别","id":"部分匹配爆炸的成因与识别"},{"level":2,"text":"索引化 join 与约束排序","id":"索引化-join-与约束排序"},{"level":2,"text":"retract 与内存回收","id":"retract-与内存回收"},{"level":2,"text":"Phreak 调度与集合化传播调优","id":"phreak-调度与集合化传播调优"},{"level":2,"text":"调优验证与常见陷阱","id":"调优验证与常见陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"议程、冲突消解与真值维护（TMS / 逻辑插入与撤销）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/business-rule-decision-engine-rete-dmnn-drools-cel-opa/rete-incremental-evaluation/agenda-conflict-resolution-truth-maintenance"},"next":{"title":"DMN 决策表建模：命中策略、优先级与规则完备性校验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/business-rule-decision-engine-rete-dmnn-drools-cel-opa/dmn-decision-table-expression/dmn-decision-table-hit-policy-completeness"}}